  "historical_output_text": " Share details like where and how this habit has become a routine part your life or how this past pursuit is changing things.\n\nHi Jess!! So much going-on but happy it's friday. Just had a thought to message because something's been eating up lots of weekend hours for ya. \n\nHave started doing more photography again lately - taking out those Canon EOS cameras we bought ages ago (they were collecting digital spider eggs lol! ) and getting out for a few photo walks on weekends now, just shooting for me.\n\nGot this little camera bag from IKEAs so everything stays contained but easy-access when grabbing. And I love just wandering the waterfront proms on Sundays now. Or maybe heading over the Bay and snapping a bunch by those wild cliffs near where you work (love your office scenery shots btw!)   \n\nI just feel this compels my gaze more towards details",
